IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
AUTHOR. 'TREVOR LITTLE'.
PROGRAM-ID. CALCULATOR.

DATA DIVISION.
  WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 WS-FIRST_NUMBER PIC S9(3).
    01 WS-SIGN PIC A(1).
    01 WS-SECOND_NUMBER PIC S9(3).
    
    01 WS-ANSWER PIC SV9(6).
    
  
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  ACCEPT WS-FIRST_NUMBER FROM CONSOLE.
  ACCEPT WS-SIGN FROM CONSOLE.
  ACCEPT WS-SECOND_NUMBER FROM CONSOLE.

  IF WS-SIGN = '+' THEN
    ADD WS-FIRST_NUMBER TO WS-SECOND_NUMBER GIVING WS-ANSWER.
        
  IF WS-SIGN = '-' THEN
    SUBTRACT WS-SECOND_NUMBER FROM WS-FIRST_NUMBER GIVING WS-ANSWER.
    
  IF WS-SIGN = '*' THEN
    MULTIPLY WS-SECOND_NUMBER BY WS-FIRST_NUMBER GIVING WS-ANSWER.
  
  IF WS-SIGN = '/' THEN
    DIVIDE WS-FIRST_NUMBER BY WS-SECOND_NUMBER GIVING WS-ANSWER.
  
  DISPLAY WS-ANSWER.

STOP RUN.
